<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Genome started as a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Genome started as a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Aegis Capital Corp analyst Frederic Greenwald said he initiated coverage of Genome Therapeutics Corp with a buy rating and a $20 target price.</p>
<p>-- &quot;At these levels, Genome is trading at a 50 percent discount to its market competition,&quot; Greenwald said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were trading up 1/8 at 7-7/8.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
